{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922053519_cdb88285","chunk_index":9,"job_id":"mwjob_bb370670e7bc8936451212fd","precondition_digest":"4a6e79ad1a018b35e8d9fb9ec3e6615eae80ab09f96c3d0a0d5c5c36ea6962d6","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v9","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_27e7b9590fd8c895","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2ac8e3c15d7050ab","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d413096e15cdc754","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b3cae21f267891a1"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922053519_cdb88285","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"允许的合并用药/治疗","missing_source_classes":["项目允许合并用药与救援治疗清单","研究者手册中的药物相互作用资料"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"现有已确认研究事实未提供允许的合并用药或治疗清单；估计目标策略仅提及使用救援治疗时按复合策略判定为无应答，未定义救援治疗的具体内容。该章节缺少形成正文所需的项目来源，需补充允许合并用药与救援治疗相关项目文件后由医学作者核对。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_27e7b9590fd8c895","section_number":"6.6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:66998617289d638155885122","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922053519_cdb88285","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"禁止的合并用药/治疗","missing_source_classes":["项目禁用合并用药与治疗清单","研究者手册中的药物相互作用与安全性资料","既往研究的禁限用药经验文件"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"现有已确认研究事实未提供禁止的合并用药或治疗清单，也未给出与研究药物相关的相互作用或禁限用规则。该章节缺少形成正文所需的项目来源，需补充禁用合并用药清单及研究药物相互作用资料后由医学作者核对。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2ac8e3c15d7050ab","section_number":"6.6.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:66998617289d638155885122","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922053519_cdb88285","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_safety_endpoint"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"1f739c14310a6a5f292991854360290460a4b501e71c36ec724647d8123a4023","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_secondary_endpoints"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:66998617289d638155885122","quote":"章节编号=7\n章节标题=研究程序和评估\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"9f1512830d016335c7f4417ade7f9a3394a44ecae16d9c1c1268963e781154e2","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:66998617289d638155885122","span_id":"span_pkt_7"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_periods","span_visits","span_safety_endpoint","span_secondary_endpoints","span_pkt_7"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"研究程序和评估","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"研究按筛选期、双盲治疗期和安全性随访期三个阶段实施。筛选期最长4周；筛选后，受试者于基线/第1天随机并进入双盲治疗期，双盲治疗期持续16周；双盲治疗期结束后进入为期4周的安全性随访期。治疗期内于第2、4、8、12、16周安排访视，并于第20周进行安全性随访。疗效评估包括PASI与sPGA，二者于基线及第4、8、12、16周进行评价；皮肤病相关生活质量采用DLQI评价。安全性评估涵盖治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件，以及实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。研究治疗依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价。","rationale":"依据的已确认事实：筛选期最长4周、双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周；筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周治疗期访视及第20周安全性随访；PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价；DLQI用于皮肤病相关生活质量评价；安全性评估涵盖TEAE、严重不良事件、导致停药的不良事件及实验室检查、生命体征、12导联心电图。需医学作者核对：DLQI的具体采集时点、各访视需实施的操作项目及安全性评估时间窗。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d413096e15cdc754","section_number":"7","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:66998617289d638155885122","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922053519_cdb88285","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。","quote_sha256":"83a818af20f1bc926d3b82a99f40c724b74d424bb2f5bb5877d194f1f72d0f93","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_dose_a"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。","quote_sha256":"ffc6cb29d83ff1fdff1723b4d70a2e3294e7e561c3310a66660f5c81fcf62439","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_compliance"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:66998617289d638155885122","quote":"章节编号=7.1\n章节标题=研究程序\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"9a756415ad9fb8b7bde202d987792d3f5a535d38ba12cb3f332dc5373b03e551","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:66998617289d638155885122","span_id":"span_pkt_71"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_periods","span_visits","span_dose_a","span_placebo","span_compliance","span_pkt_71"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"heading":"研究程序","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"受试者进入筛选期，筛选期最长4周，用于完成入选标准与排除标准的评估。筛选后，受试者于基线/第1天随机并开始接受双盲治疗：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服、每日一次，对照组接受匹配安慰剂、每日一次，均自第1天持续至第16周。双盲治疗期内安排第2、4、8、12、16周访视，PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。第16周治疗期访视完成后，受试者进入为期4周的安全性随访期，并于第20周完成安全性随访。治疗依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记进行评价。","rationale":"依据的已确认事实：筛选期最长4周及入选/排除标准评估；筛选后于基线/第1天随机；试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg每日一次口服、对照组接受匹配安慰剂每日一次，均自第1天持续至第16周；第2、4、8、12、16周治疗期访视；4周安全性随访期及第20周安全性随访；依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价。需医学作者核对：各访视具体操作项目、研究实施细节及给药相关处理规则。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b3cae21f267891a1","section_number":"7.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:66998617289d638155885122","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:66998617289d638155885122","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:66998617289d638155885122","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"8a80f1030a1e60bca881bb1a0fe80751fadcea9aba982af1f2c08cdb9c99805a"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"}]}